    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d67">

                <pb facs="0301" n="43" xml:id="pg43"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/2381</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-29T11:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 29, 1915, 11 a. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 2.15 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>341. Before declaring war against Turkey Italy will wait till opportunity given
                    Italians to leave Ottoman Empire. It is believed Greece will advance immediately
                    in Albania. Bulgaria seems present key of situation; will probably espouse the
                    cause of Allies if Italy sends considerable forces to Dardanelles but at the
                    moment Italy seems fully occupied with Austria.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
